    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University has won the Occupational Safety Health and Environment (OHSE) Award 2011 for its outstanding performance in the service sector for the year 2010-2011. The award is a testament to the University's commitment to quality and safety, and to the programmes, staff trainings and hazard surveillance processes it has put into place. The OHSE Award is arranged by the Employers' Federation of Pakistan in collaboration with the International Labour Organization and is presented annually on April 28 on the occasion of World Day on Safety and Health at Work.",
